{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00325",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.89,
      "end_seconds": 8.49,
      "duration_seconds": 7.6,
      "text": "Doctor, the patient's with us now. I did the usual checks at the front, so just say when you want them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.73,
      "end_seconds": 13.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Thank you. Good morning, tell me what's been going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 13.7,
      "end_seconds": 18.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. I hope it's alright if I stay in for this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.26,
      "end_seconds": 22.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "It's pain low in the pelvis, mostly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.59,
      "end_seconds": 24.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Right, when did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.63,
      "end_seconds": 27.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Since Friday, that's when it began."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.45,
      "end_seconds": 38.73,
      "duration_seconds": 9.28,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse. It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.76,
      "end_seconds": 45.76,
      "duration_seconds": 6.0,
      "text": "A hot water bottle helps a bit. I'd say moderate. I'd say every other day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.34,
      "end_seconds": 51.65,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "I was just going to say that the main thing is—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 51.75,
      "end_seconds": 56.93,
      "duration_seconds": 5.18,
      "text": "Sorry to cut in, doctor, quick question: shall I bring the trolley in now or later?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.93,
      "end_seconds": 61.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "Later, thanks. Please go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.11,
      "end_seconds": 71.99,
      "duration_seconds": 8.88,
      "text": "As for pain during sex, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 73.35,
      "end_seconds": 76.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "Yes, that's right, that's how it was."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.34,
      "end_seconds": 80.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Any missed period, burning when passing urine, vaginal discharge or vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.4,
      "end_seconds": 92.39,
      "duration_seconds": 10.99,
      "text": "No, you know, no missed period, no burning when passing urine, no vaginal discharge. I did have bloating at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.46,
      "end_seconds": 97.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any fever or bleeding between periods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.13,
      "end_seconds": 100.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "No, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.79,
      "end_seconds": 104.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "So, anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.57,
      "end_seconds": 106.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "No, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.57,
      "end_seconds": 109.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.82,
      "end_seconds": 123.65,
      "duration_seconds": 12.83,
      "text": "I have eczema, for five years. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible. I have gout. I have depression."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.92,
      "end_seconds": 130.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.6,
      "text": "Right. Right, so that's your known eczema. We'll keep that in mind today. Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.27,
      "end_seconds": 133.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Yeah, no, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.37,
      "end_seconds": 147.74,
      "duration_seconds": 13.37,
      "text": "I like to make sure you understand what's happening, so please stop me at any point. There are no silly questions, and I'd much rather you ask now than go home still wondering about something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.08,
      "end_seconds": 150.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Right, I understand now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.61,
      "end_seconds": 153.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Right, how about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.31,
      "end_seconds": 157.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "I smoke, yes, around five a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.76,
      "end_seconds": 159.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.13,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.41,
      "end_seconds": 166.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "A beer or two most evenings, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.42,
      "end_seconds": 175.46,
      "duration_seconds": 6.04,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.6,
      "end_seconds": 189.13,
      "duration_seconds": 10.53,
      "text": "Hmm, there was some antibiotic, I was told I was allergic. But I couldn't tell you what it was called or what it did."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.45,
      "end_seconds": 193.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.7,
      "end_seconds": 200.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.82,
      "text": "It's a... um, I can't remember what it's called. It's a little pink tablet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.96,
      "end_seconds": 203.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Do you remember what it's for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.49,
      "end_seconds": 214.16,
      "duration_seconds": 10.67,
      "text": "For the gout, I believe. My son sets them out for me, I just take what I'm given. I'm on escitalopram, 10 milligrams, maybe, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.17,
      "end_seconds": 219.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Did you happen to bring the box or the paperwork?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.94,
      "end_seconds": 229.3,
      "duration_seconds": 6.36,
      "text": "No, it's at home. Uh, I'm on mefenamic acid, 500 milligrams, when it hurts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 230.41,
      "end_seconds": 234.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 1000 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.39,
      "end_seconds": 237.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Alright. Did you bring the up-to-date prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 238.94,
      "end_seconds": 242.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.48,
      "end_seconds": 256.79,
      "duration_seconds": 13.31,
      "text": "Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.3,
      "end_seconds": 260.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 261.05,
      "end_seconds": 270.72,
      "duration_seconds": 9.67,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Pulse is 71 beats a minute, BP is 117 over 72, SpO2 99 percent on room air, temperature 36.9."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.88,
      "end_seconds": 272.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.37,
      "end_seconds": 277.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 278.13,
      "end_seconds": 278.83,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.79,
      "end_seconds": 287.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.13,
      "end_seconds": 292.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.12,
      "end_seconds": 295.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "Bear with me a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.7,
      "end_seconds": 313.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "There's tenderness in the lower tummy on the left, and no guarding."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 314.04,
      "end_seconds": 314.74,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.32,
      "end_seconds": 347.77,
      "duration_seconds": 27.45,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together. From what you've told me and what I found, it fits best with chronic pelvic pain, possibly endometriosis. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. It could also be an ovarian cyst, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 348.92,
      "end_seconds": 352.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Is it something serious, um, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 353.42,
      "end_seconds": 368.23,
      "duration_seconds": 14.81,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with chronic pelvic pain, possibly endometriosis do well once it's treated properly. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had pain low in the pelvis, since Friday, moderate, and no vomiting or bleeding between periods."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 369.23,
      "end_seconds": 370.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 371.47,
      "end_seconds": 380.54,
      "duration_seconds": 9.07,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a pelvic ultrasound for pelvic pain. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 380.97,
      "end_seconds": 386.05,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "Doctor, I did a pregnancy test before they came in, the result's on your screen."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 387.65,
      "end_seconds": 391.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "So, good, thank you. Any scans or blood work done already?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 392.27,
      "end_seconds": 398.35,
      "duration_seconds": 6.08,
      "text": "I did have a swab test done last year, but the paper's at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 398.95,
      "end_seconds": 422.13,
      "duration_seconds": 23.18,
      "text": "A heat pad and some gentle movement help many people, and a pain diary helps me see a pattern. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference. I'll also refer you to a gynaecologist. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 422.86,
      "end_seconds": 424.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 425.24,
      "end_seconds": 436.16,
      "duration_seconds": 10.92,
      "text": "If the pain becomes sudden and severe or you faint, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department. I'd like to see you again in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 437.27,
      "end_seconds": 437.97,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 438.5,
      "end_seconds": 445.49,
      "duration_seconds": 6.99,
      "text": "Before we finish, can you repeat the plan back to me so I know I haven't been confusing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 446.84,
      "end_seconds": 450.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "So, I come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 451.31,
      "end_seconds": 455.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 456.67,
      "end_seconds": 458.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Thank you. I'll see you then."
    }
  ]
}